#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "About &showfoto;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "&showfoto; is a fast Image Editor with powerful image editing tools. You can use it to view your photographs and improve them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reporting Bugs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Like the rest of &kde;, &showfoto; is an Open Source project. This means that it relies on its users to play their part by, at least, reporting problems and suggesting possible improvements."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "&showfoto; makes it as easy as possible for you to report bugs or suggest improvements. Wherever you are in the application the Help menu will include a Report Bugs option. This will display a message box with a highlighted link. Click on the link and your web browser will open the page for the reporting system. All the information required will already be filled in, just follow the instructions for completing your report."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Ünnerstütten"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "&showfoto; is a community supported project, which means that users and developers support one another. If you become a regular user of &showfoto; you are encouraged to join the &showfoto; Users Mailing List. You can start off by asking questions of other &showfoto; users and hopefully soon you will be answering the support questions of others."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: ulink
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "&showfoto; Users Mailing List joining instructions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can also visit the <ulink url=\"http://www.digikam.org\">&digikam; Home Page.</ulink> for news of new releases and other &showfoto; related information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting Involved"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are many ways that you can get involved with the continued development of &showfoto;. You do not need to be a software developer. You can help with documentation, translation and user interface design or just contribute really good ideas to the wish-list. You can also get involved by testing early development code as it is being developed and providing feedback to the developers. Of course, if you are a software developer then you can help to make &showfoto; the best digital photograph application there is."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "The best way to start getting involved with &showfoto; is to join the Developers Mailing List. <ulink url=\"https://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/digikam-devel\">&showfoto; Developer Mailing List joining instructions.</ulink>"
msgstr ""

